 "headline": "Herro Drops Fifty While Beard Climbs",
 "notes": [
  "Tyler Herro has 50 points and seven threes for MONSTARS, yet the team still trails Adam Silver Dez Nuts 4-7. One man cannot carry that mess.",
  "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw just flipped OREB, DREB and TO away from theInfamous, now leading 7-4 after trailing last update.",
  "Saddiq Bey is 1-for-9 with 2 points tonight for Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw, and his team still gained ground. Dumb luck.",
  "Joel Embiid has 26, 17 and 9 for LeParth James, while Naji Marshall's 0-for-3 adds nothing. LeParth leads 8-3 anyway.",
  "theInfamous is losing DREB while Khaman Maluach sits on the bench with five boards from earlier this week. Nobody asked the bench."
 ],
